# Binary files must never go through line-ending conversion. Git's own
# heuristic usually gets this right, but core.autocrlf is a per-clone setting
# this repo doesn't control — a contributor with it set to `true` on Windows
# is one CRLF pass away from a corrupted apk that fails to install with no
# useful error message. Be explicit instead of relying on the heuristic.
*.apk binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
